refactor(examples/typescript): dedupe pricing tax rule into lineTotal

orderTotal re-implemented the subtotal/tax branch of lineTotal. Delegate
to lineTotal to keep one source of truth; accumulation order is preserved
so floating-point results are unchanged. Add a characterization test for
